<title>HONG KONG: Pacific Electric to set US$ FRN.</title>
<headline>Pacific Electric to set US$ FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Pacific Electric Wire and Cable Co Ltd is issuing a floating rate note via a special purpose company called Gellatin International, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal is guaranteed by Pacific Electric Wire and Cable Co.</p>
<p>The issue size is expected to be at least US$100 million, bankers said.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years with a call option in year three.</p>
<p>Sanwa International Finance is the mandated arranger.</p>
<p>General syndication is expected to start in two weeks.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
